  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "同类卡连续打出可把倍率叠到5倍，低费卡会重置连锁，延长还是打断构成逐回合抉择。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Chain same-type cards to stack a multiplier up to ×5 . Low-cost cards reset the chain — when to extend and when to break is the core turn-by-turn decision.",
