      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "迷雾地图从5×5扩张到8×8，战斗、精英、事件、商店、宝箱与灵魂祭坛自由分支。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Maps grow from 5×5 to 8×8 , hidden until explored. Battle, Elite, Event, Shop, Chest, and Soul Altar rooms branch freely — 27+ decision events ensure no two runs share a path.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4771890/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "构筑层同时提供定向卡牌升级、6类宝石镶嵌、40多件遗物与灵魂祭坛永久成长。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Card Upgrades — pick your target manually, side-by-side before/after preview Gem Socketing — 6 gem types with clear on-card effects Relics — 40+ relics that reshape your build Soul Altar — spend souls for permanent meta-progress",
